        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not overfill the calzone. Too much filling and it bursts. Seal the edge firmly by crimping or folding it over. Brush the top with olive oil and cut a small steam vent so it does not burst in the oven."
          }
        ]
